// GIVEN — the naive DFT, in this track's two-plane form:
//   output: [256, 2]  →  result[0][k] = real part of bin k
//                        result[1][k] = imaginary part of bin k
// (k * i) % n keeps every angle inside one turn: a float32 cos() has lost
